    <comment>New package virt-template0.2: virt-template 0.2.2, the KubeVirt add-on providing VirtualMachineTemplate resources. KubeVirt 1.9 pins this release; virt-operator deploys its API server and controller from the images built from this package (bsc#1272604).

Versioned package so the minor a KubeVirt release pins can ship next to the next one. Tarball is upstream v0.2.2 with its vendored Go modules updated (go.mod/go.sum/vendor only, no source changes).
</comment>
